    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know it's a symptom or whatever, but it doesn't change the fact that i feel like a bug in the code. like the world is this huge, perfect program and i'm just this bit of corrupted data that's slowing everything down. it's exhausting trying to pretend i'm \"real\" when i just feel like a hollow placeholder. it just feels like i don't belong in this version of reality.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
