      "content": "The weight of feeling like an outsider in reality is incredibly heavy to carry. That sense of not belonging suggests a deep need for genuine connection and validation. Instead of focusing on the \"bug\" metaphor, maybe try seeking out small, tangible moments in your day that feel uniquely *yours*. A mindful grounding exercise, like focusing intensely on the texture of an object, can sometimes help reconnect you to your physical presence.",
      "source": "target",
